  Description: Prerequisite Region - Mwangi Expanse As an experienced sailor from
    Senghor, you know that the only thing saving you from disaster on the high seas
    is a properly maintained ship. You know boat-building inside and out and you
    can quickly cobble together a solution in the event that something breaks. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Crafting skill and the Sailing Lore skill.
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick Repair] skill feat.
